WEBVTT

00:05:28.218 --> 00:05:31.328
Steve the I.T. guy and I are really
just not meant for each other,

00:05:31.352 --> 00:05:32.915
but we'll part ways as friends,

00:05:32.939 --> 00:05:35.364
when he gets up to go to the bathroom,

00:05:35.388 --> 00:05:38.515
and in the meantime,
the bill comes to our table.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.564
And listen, I'm a modern woman.

00:05:41.588 --> 00:05:43.929
I am totally down with splitting the bill.

00:05:44.549 --> 00:05:47.081
But then Steve the I.T. guy
didn't come back.

00:05:47.105 --> 00:05:48.191
(Gasping)

00:05:48.215 --> 00:05:51.596
And that was my entire month's rent.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.954
(Audience gasps)

00:05:52.978 --> 00:05:56.227
So needless to say,
I was not having a good night.

00:05:56.251 --> 00:05:59.928
So I run home, I call
my mother, I call my sister,

00:05:59.952 --> 00:06:04.126
and as I do, at the end of each one
of these terrible, terrible dates,